Z||000000||AkursedX||05-21-2001||09:42 PM||||Ok, I was out at Mighty Taco and I park next to a gold dodge intrepid which was bone stock.  Had some chrome on it and tinted windows.  1st off, it had little japanese letters on the back side windows, and the on the front side windows, it had stickers the said "Powered By"...............POWERED BY WHO??????  <BR>Then after I was eating, I went grocery shopping, and on my way in to the parking lot, the car in front of me had a sticker that said "The Worlds Most Versatile Sport Utility Vechicle"  Now to me, this sticker is stupid enough to begin with, but the stupidity was multiplied tenfold due to the fact that it was on an Early 90's Ford TAURUS!!<P>I wish I knew what these people were thinking!||||reg||1
