Z||000006||DaRkLoRD||05-22-2001||02:23 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Sootah:<BR><B>Do you people out there in other parts of the country get the people that put the huge freakin Oakely stickin in their windshield? I freakin hate that! EVERYBODY does it, and 90% of the people that do are driving beaters and don't even own a pair of Oakelys! BAH!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'd never get one of those... and I even own 2 pairs of Oakleys.. and a pair of Ray-Bans.. but what sunglasses do I actually wear?? clip-ons... can't get wrap-around oakleys, or ray-bans, with perscription lenses... I hate wearing glasses now..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Another thing, I once saw a Mustang sticker on a small car (I think a Miata..?) wasn't a mustang, that's for sure.<P>------------------<BR>   <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>   <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
