Z||000008||Raydar||05-22-2001||09:27 AM||||Friend of mine took his bike in for service. Was telling me about another bike that was there. Think it was a Suzuki something-or-other. The fairing and the rest of the bodywork was all scratched and busted to $hit. Looked like it had been laid down more than once. <BR>Displayed proudly on the fairing was "No Fear".<BR>Apparently not.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 black Formula<BR>88 Duke coupe <BR>88 "wadded up" Formula (parts car)||||reg||1
