Z||000010||Cheever2||05-22-2001||10:40 AM||||The only sticker we have between 3 vehicles is on the CheeverMobile, er, our minivan, which says "Cheever Fever".  I got it and a T-shirt and some other stuff cause I won a trivia question way back when Eddie had a real fan club.  The best thing about the sticker is it helps us find the van quicker in a big parking lot (it's at the top of the back window).  Even had it on there when we were at the 98 Indy 500, and watched My Man win the big one.<P>Anyway, it means something to me.  I wonder what the ones described above mean to their owners.  Not much I bet.<BR>||||reg||1
